BT\n/F1 10 Tf\n50 720 Td\n15 TL\n(Job Requisition: Lead Product Designer) Tj\nT*\n(Company: FinTech Velocity) Tj\nT*\n(Role Overview: Lead end-to-end design for our core mobile payments app.) Tj\nT*\n(Responsibilities:) Tj\nT*\n(- Own design system and UX architectures across iOS and Android) Tj\nT*\n(- Conduct usability tests with over 50 global merchant partners) Tj\nT*\n(- Mentor junior and mid-level product designers) Tj\nT*\n(Requirements:) Tj\nT*\n(- 6+ years of UX/UI product design experience) Tj\nT*\n(- Mastery of Figma and design system tokens) Tj\nT*\n(- Strong portfolio showcasing shipped consumer mobile apps) Tj\nT*\n(Nice to have:) Tj\nT*\n(- Experience in fintech or banking applications) Tj\nT*\n(- Basic knowledge of HTML/CSS and frontend constraints) Tj\nT*\n(Company Overview:) Tj\nT*\n(FinTech Velocity is a Series-B mobile payments platform.) Tj\nT*\n(Why Join Us:) Tj\nT*\n(High ownership, fast-growing design team, and high-impact fintech product.) Tj\nT*\n(Benefits:) Tj\nT*\n(- Competitive salary ,000 - ,000 plus equity) Tj\nT*\n(- 100% employer-covered health, dental, and vision insurance) Tj\nT*\n(- 401k match up to 5%) Tj\nT*\n(Equal Opportunity:) Tj\nT*\n(FinTech Velocity is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.) Tj\nT*\nET
